# Personal access token for OSF API v2.
# Generate at https://osf.io/settings/tokens (scope: osf.full_read suffices for
# preprint discovery). Required by all scripts in this folder.
#
# Provide it as a shell environment variable:
#
#     export OSF_TOKEN=...
#
# Add the line to ~/.zshrc / ~/.bashrc to survive restarts. (Unlike the
# Semantic Scholar client, osf_client.py does NOT auto-load .env files —
# the shell env var is the only mechanism. This .env.example is a
# placeholder for documentation purposes only.)

OSF_TOKEN=your_token_here
